    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a journey in <i>Clumsy</i>, a first person horror adventure game about collecting Uncle Steve\u2019s Sauce and figuring out why the Nina acts this way. The Nina, once a well known star in the unreleased <i>Chro-Master</i> game, Naughty Nina, now a slab of mass trying to end what it started and put itself out of misery; however, soon you might have to handle things yourself. Collect Uncle Steve\u2019s sauce and bring it to the Cheeny Geeny as he may be able to help you along this journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a journey in <i>Clumsy</i>, a first person horror adventure game about collecting Uncle Steve\u2019s Sauce and figuring out why the Nina acts this way. The Nina, once a well known star in the unreleased <i>Chro-Master</i> game, Naughty Nina, now a slab of mass trying to end what it started and put itself out of misery; however, soon you might have to handle things yourself. Collect Uncle Steve\u2019s sauce and bring it to the Cheeny Geeny as he may be able to help you along this journey.</p>",
